<title>USA: Ahmanson says bid proposal deemed complete.</title>
<headline>Ahmanson says bid proposal deemed complete.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson and Co on Tuesday said an application regarding its proposal to buy Great Western Financial Corp was deemed complete by the Office of Thrift Supervision (OTS).</p>
<p>Ahmanson said that represented an important step in the approval process at the federal regulatory body.</p>
<p>Earlier Tuesday, Ahmanson's offer was rejected by Great Western, which agreed to merge with Washington Mutual Inc in early March in an effort to thwart the hostile bid by the rival California savings and loan association.</p>
</text>
